:"Muning","textMapHash":1067238178,"text":"What? You seriously broke the Seven-Star Array? Ugh, looks like I'll have to write this into the weekly report...","nextNodeIds":[710830102]},{"nodeId":710830102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3957080714,"text":"Make sure you make it sound cool, alright?","nextNodeIds":[710830103]},{"nodeId":710830103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2061,"speakerName":"Muning","textMapHash":2364265578,"text":"*cough* Please, this is a very serious situation. It's so serious, in fact, that the Qixing themselves will decide its exact seriousness.","nextNodeIds":[710830104]},{"nodeId":710830104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2061,"speakerName":"Muning","textMapHash":992810218,"text":"Which is to say that once report gets sent up, someone from the Qixing might personally come down here to stop you.","nextNodeIds":[710830105]},{"nodeId":710830105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2061,"speakerName":"Muning","textMapHash":2658161826,"text":"Even I won't be able to save you then.","nextNodeIds":[710830106]},{"nodeId":710830106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3941499194,"text":"(This guy is way too obvious with his hints...)","nextNodeIds":[710830107]},{"nodeId":710830107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2061,"speakerName":"Muning","textMapHash":1367507258,"text":"Scared, huh? Alright, move along, then! There's still someone waiting for you, you know?","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7108301,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7103711,3],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_QUEST_STATE_EQUAL","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYE